WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.620
That's why I told you to buy a new one...

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.670
This truck's a piece of junk.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.980
Yeah.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:10.820
Shut up!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.120
Stop complaining...

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.140
I'd love to retire this thing.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.280
Your husband just doesn't make enough money—

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.640
That's mean!

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.910
It isn't Pedro's fault... It's the economy.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.960
I'm sure Kal and Ari will be surprised

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.410
when they hear Noelle's married, with a kid.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.490
So many people...

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:40.140
They've all come to see tomorrow's 
welcoming ceremony.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.980
Welcoming ceremony, huh?

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.130
The government has some nerve,

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:49.580
considering that they sent all those 
people to Isla to get rid of them.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.370
And there we go!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:55.530
Get in, you two... It's getting late.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.430
Tomorrow, we have to be first on-site.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:01.290
After all, it's our kids' big day.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:04.290
Yeah!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:45.530
<b>Episode 13 
The Sky Where You Are</b>

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.940
Speed 15 knots.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.270
As planned, we'll be home by morning.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.840
Then our journey's finally at an end.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.250
It's been a long time...

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:59.030
But learning our world looks like this is a surprise.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:04.730
The three seas Saint Aldista 
created to catch the rain

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.940
are these three oceans, in a staircase formation.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:12.540
The first stair, the second stair, 
and the third... Three seas.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:18.230
Supporting them, the giant 
bedrock is the flagstone.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:22.550
And this edge is the End of the Sky.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.220
A rainbow wall created to keep 
seawater from pouring off the edge.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.810
The water is absorbed by the wall 
and temporarily destroyed...

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:35.310
Before spurting up from the Holy Spring, 
which is the center of the world.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:39.440
This shape... It resembles a larger Isla.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.710
Perhaps our world is actually a special structure

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:47.160
that Saint Aldista created.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.530
Balsteros is located here...

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:54.720
We passed through the Holy Spring

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:59.000
and this sea, where the Holy Levamme Empire lies.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.010
We then went to the End 
of the Sky and returned.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:06.170
It's hard to believe, and I was here...

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:10.760
I doubt the hard-headed idiots in 
the government will believe it.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.810
Hard-headed idiots?

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.650
What are you trying to say?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.260
You little—

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.790
Enough...

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.620
If Balsteros and Levamme work together,

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:25.410
we could solve even deeper 
mysteries of this world.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.230
High Consul Fana Levamme says the same.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:32.870
But it'll be hard to persuade Balsteros.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.740
We have all the cards we need.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:46.890
You're...

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.690
Nina Viento, no...

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.910
Claire Cruz's friend.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:56.900
When she left, I saw you at 
the Mercurius flight zone.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.890
Is that all?

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:01.680
You are Leopald Melze, former commander

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.040
of the Balsteros Imperial Army.

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:06.360
The Imperial Army?

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.830
Why bring that up?

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.650
It's been almost ten years 
since the Wind Revolution...

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.200
Impossible.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.110
It's been a long time, sir.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.950
We last met was at the palace 
when I was quite young.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:33.600
Everyone, I'm seeing something unbelievable...

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:38.230
The flying island Isla's crew, 
which left our nation, has returned!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.730
With the help of our unknown ally,

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:46.820
the Holy Levamme Empire!

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.270
I would like to begin by thanking Saint Aldista!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:57.700
And all those who believed in, and waited for, us.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:02.210
After making our treaty with the Sky Clan,

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:06.600
we passed through the Holy 
Spring and back to the sea,

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.520
where we set course for the 
Holy Levamme Empire.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.810
<i>Admiral Luis told them everything...</i>

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.440
<i>That the legendary Sky Clan was real.</i>

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.690
<i>That we fought them.</i>

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:24.060
<i>And how we met the Holy Levamme Empire.</i>

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.440
<i>About Isla's end.</i>

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:32.370
Now then, I'd like to introduce 
someone to all of you.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.960
The former Balsteros Empire's crown prince...

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:37.790
Karl La Hire!

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.590
Hello, everyone.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:55.880
I am the one who was once 
known as Karl La Hire.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.640
I have revealed my identity

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.230
because I'd like to make a request.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.470
Kal!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:02.560
No way!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.120
Wait, what? Are you serious?

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.220
The prince died in the revolution...

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.610
Don't be fooled. He's a fake!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:18.250
I have not come here to 
discuss politics with you.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.500
I would like to retrieve someone.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.690
She went to enemy lands

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:28.520
as a hostage, so Isla could continue its voyage.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.680
Her name is Nina Viento!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:38.830
Yes, the leader of the Wind Revolution 
that you all remember so well.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.680
The Governor of Isla, Nina Viento.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:47.370
When I first arrived at Isla, I hated her.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:52.660
I hated the power of the wind 
that had taken my rank

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.780
and my mother away from me...

00:07:56.020 --> 00:08:01.040
I participated in the Isla plan 
to take revenge on her.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:07.120
But Isla taught me so much...

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.170
The people I met there

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:13.580
spoke to me and led me.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.930
To forgive, not hate!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:21.100
That, alone, can bring us a better tomorrow.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:25.900
We can build a happy future for everyone.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.610
I want to retake the girl I love!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.400
At her side,

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:32.400
I want to create the future!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.280
The girl he loves?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.410
Does that mean...

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:39.910
I...

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.830
I love Nina Viento!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:54.760
Everyone, please let us 
begin a second Isla Plan!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:09:00.510
I want to start a journey to force the Sky Clan 
to open relations with us, and retake Nina!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.290
I'm surprised.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.240
This is more than I expected.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.330
To take advantage of the historical romance, 
and bring the public to our side...

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:15.070
Wasn't that your plan, Foreign Affairs Minister?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:15.780
Yes.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.560
In every era, people have always loved drama.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.290
With their support,

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:25.790
it's quite possible to overthrow 
the revolutionary government.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.300
Why didn't you tell me until the last second?

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.250
I didn't want you opposing me...

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:36.880
And I wanted to see your reaction when I did.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:41.180
It's just the kind of guy I am... 
I hope you'll forgive me.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.070
Especially after all we've been through.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.980
That won't happen.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:54.360
Governor, wait a little longer.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.170
We'll be there soon.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.470
And the man you love will be with us...

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.170
Hey, Kal...

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.780
That was amazing.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.750
Stop it, Noripii.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.980
That was quite the proposal.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.770
You were great... Really wonderful, Kal!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.930
My face is still all red!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:24.040
Yeah, I'm amazed you said all that 
embarrassing stuff in public!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.100
Amazing...

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.850
Amazingly embarrassing.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.940
What do you mean, "embarrassing"?

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:33.690
When Kal first told us about 
his identity and his plan,

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.390
I was stunned.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:38.530
Oh, come on... It was wonderful.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.700
I'm sure Claire will be happy.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.330
Thank you.

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.830
Come, everyone, and let's take a picture.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.480
I heard you're going to teach 
at a civilian flight school?

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:57.530
Yeah.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:00.340
Teaching little kids like you.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.240
The gorilla-woman will be going with me.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.880
Who are you calling a gorilla?!

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.220
Weirdo...

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.270
If you want, you can go right back to the military.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.060
I'm going to try and become a teacher again.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:17.030
I'll miss you, but I'll be wishing you good luck.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.930
If you all grow up to be splendid adults,

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:23.620
that would make me happier than anything...

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.400
Teacher!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.250
I will never forget how you saved me.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.280
Nor will I.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:33.290
Me, neither!

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.440
Everyone...

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:38.800
I'm taking the picture.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.350
Here I go.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:47.060
Cadoques High, Aerial Division 
students, as of today, you...

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:51.440
Happy graduation!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.320
H-Huh?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:00.860
Where's the RA?

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.370
Contact the mother country.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.080
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:17.560
If there's a new Isla Plan, 
we'll have to intervene.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.130
Kal, look!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.260
Welcome back!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.220
Kal... Ari!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.300
You've grown up so much!

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.770
Sisters...

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:36.190
Welcome back, kids.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.550
I'm home!

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.680
You got even bigger...

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.910
What have you been eating?

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.790
I'm back, Father!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:58.390
You're a man, so don't cry.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.100
Kal... Ari...

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.050
Welcome home!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.140
It has a good sound...

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.670
Ari tunes it.

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:22.070
When I try, she won't let me touch it.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.780
She thinks she's a real engineer, huh?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.530
We were both in this when 
we saw the End of the Sky.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.540
It was amazing...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.540
I couldn't have imagined it.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.790
I see.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.740
Hang on tight!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.550
I need to talk to you about something.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.400
Tomorrow, I'm going back to Alexandra.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:57.310
There are many things I need to 
do before my new journey.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.410
Get going.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:01.800
Aren't you going to save the girl you love?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:09.270
That's so great... That's my son!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:10.950
Yeah?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.700
Damn! You really have grown up...

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.660
You're starting a fight that 
involves the whole world,

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.210
all to save the woman you love, huh?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.590
Go up!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.130
Fly even higher.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.380
Right.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.580
Everyone... Cheers!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.270
Drink! Drink! Eat! Eat!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.570
You won't be eating like this for a while...

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.480
Look at who I've got!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.990
<i>Just look at him.</i>

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.520
<i>He's grown up, and it's kind of weird.</i>

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.030
Kal, this is...

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.230
The Aerial Knights' next main 
fighter plane, the Maestra.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:33.540
Its top speed is over 700 kmph.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.890
A fixed-wing single seater.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.730
Admiral Luis got me a prototype.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.980
A single-wing single seater is 
their primary fighter, huh?

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.290
Times have changed.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:45.970
I'm off.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:46.700
Yeah.

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:49.140
I look forward to seeing your wife.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.170
Yeah, I'll bring her back.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.950
Don't do anything too crazy.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:53.960
That's right.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.390
Make sure you come back!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:59.030
Yeah... Believe in me, Noelle and Manuelle.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.230
Kal...

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.570
Ari...

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.160
You aren't saying goodbye to me?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.780
N-No, that isn't true...

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.100
Well, it's a bit late for that!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:22.050
And I don't like big goodbyes.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.020
Ari...

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.170
I...

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:32.350
Well, thank you.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.130
It was because of you

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.970
that I...

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.270
Kal...

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:45.850
Ari...

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:49.510
You were about to say something 
cheesy, weren't you?

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:52.810
I sensed the danger, so I punched 
you without thinking.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.450
Sorry!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.240
What?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.640
I haven't even said anything yet!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.170
Why act like this now?

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:00.120
Right, right.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.090
I get it... Go.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:05.420
Go, get Claire, and then head home!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.790
That's all you have to do.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:10.670
Ari...

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:11.920
Go!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.550
I said go, dummy!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.640
Yeah, I know.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.860
I'm going, I'm going!

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.140
I'll be back!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.490
Don't return until you have her!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.850
I know that...

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:41.120
Jeez... For a little sister, you're pushy!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.410
And you're my little brother!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.790
You're my little sister!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.830
Little brother!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.080
Little sister!

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.840
I'll be back, everyone.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:20.820
Goodbye... My prince.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.020
Some love songs can't be sung.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.790
It's for the best, isn't it?

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:29.410
Isn't it?

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:39.260
You'd better return, stupid brother!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.640
And bring Claire with you!

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.500
Yes? Who is it?

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:15.000
Is this the home of Mitsuo Fukuhara's parents?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:18.300
Y-Yes.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.000
My name is Chiharu de Lucia.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.070
I was his fellow student.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:30.850
I wanted to give you this personally.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.960
I heard you made the Ciela Sazard Aerial Guard.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.270
Congratulations.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.960
When will you be leaving?

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.300
Next month.

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:51.960
I need to prepare...

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.330
By the time the flowers bloom,

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.460
we'll be over Haizuran skies.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.680
I want to be your right arm.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.930
Sharon...

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:13.260
So just wait a little while.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:16.940
I'll do my best, and I'll catch up soon.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.860
On your days off, come and see me, okay?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.150
Yes.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:25.370
In a plane, 500 kilometers is nothing.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.390
Congratulations on your return!

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:36.360
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:37.810
Thanks!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.000
Seriously, what's wrong with you?

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:46.440
<i>Everyone returned to their lives.</i>

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:48.980
<i>And then...</i>

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.060
Enemy flying fortress, distance 30,000 meters.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:12.910
They're here.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.370
Sir...

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.540
Open fire.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:22.590
Fighters, engage enemy escorts.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.580
Bombers, attack enemy fortress!

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.380
That's the silver fox!

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:54.740
Thanks!

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:12.680
Come on!

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:37.830
I'm almost there.

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:40.080
Wait for me, okay?

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>Kal...</i>

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:46.310
<i>Kal?</i>

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:49.720
Claire?

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.720
<i>Kal, the sky's so blue again today, isn't it?</i>

00:22:56.930 --> 00:23:00.190
<i>Do you remember the day we first met?</i>

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:02.730
Yeah, I'll never forget it!

00:23:04.060 --> 00:23:06.130
Ever since I first saw you,

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:10.220
you were the only one I ever cared for.

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:15.990
I'm coming, Claire... To the sky where you are!

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:19.560
<i>I'll take her back.</i>

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:21.460
<i>And then, I'll never let her go.</i>

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:26.690
<i>We'll be together forever, 
flying through this sky.</i>

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:32.630
<i>Flying in an infinite summer sky, 
singing an endless song of love!</i>
